<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/48/eng@/~cl_6__para_ii> <https://schema.org/text> "If the Court finds that the prosecution has proved its case beyond reasonable doubt, the Court shall find the accused guilty and he may be convicted thereon."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/48/eng@> .
